></span><span className={"custom-dim-label"}>{"6 min read"}</span><span className={"custom-dim-run"}></span></span></div></div></section><section id={"c3-art-figure"} className={"custom-section"} aria-label={"Lead photograph"}><div className={"container"}><figure className={"custom-art-hero-figure grid gap-5"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><div className={"custom-art-hero-frame custom-chamfer relative aspect-[21/9] bg-muted max-md:aspect-[4/3]"}><img className={"absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover"} src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/2880x1234.svg"} alt={"Two engineers before the Kestrel Crossing twin on the control-room wall"} width={"2880"} height={"1234"} fetchPriority={"high"} decoding={"async"} /><span className={"custom-cross"} aria-hidden={"true"}></span></div><figcaption className={"custom-art-caption grid gap-3.5 text-[1rem] leading-[1.55] text-start text-soft"}><span className={"custom-dim"} style={{"--dim-delay": "0.3s"}} data-anim={""}><span className={"custom-dim-run"}></span><span className={"custom-dim-label"}>{"1,240 m · one model"}</span><span className={"custom-dim-run"}></span></span><span className={"max-w-184"}>{"The Kestrel Crossing twin in the project control room: 38 months of design, construction and inspection in one place."}</span></figcaption></figure></div></section><section id={"c3-art"} className={"custom-section pt-0"} aria-labelledby={"c3-art-label"}><h2 id={"c3-art-label"} className={"sr-only"}>{"Article"}</h2><article className={"article-body custom-art-body text-[clamp(1.0625rem,1.02rem_+_0.2vw,1.1875rem)]"}><div className={"custom-art-byline grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] items-center gap-y-1 gap-x-4 pb-7 border-b border-b-(--custom-line) sm:grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)_auto]"}><img className={"row-[span_2] size-14 object-cover"} src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/800x1067.svg"} alt={""} width={"800"} height={"1067"} style={{"objectPosition": "50% 20%"}} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /><p className={"grid text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.4]"}><strong className={"font-heading text-[1.0625rem]"}>{"Laura Stewart"}</strong><span>{"Head of Digital"}</span></p><ul className={"custom-art-facts flex flex-wrap gap-y-1 gap-x-5 text-[0.9375rem] sm:col-[3] sm:row-[1_/_span_2]"} role={"list"}><li className={"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"}><i className={"ph ph-calendar-blank"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i><time datetime={"2026-10-12"}>{"12 Oct 2026"}</time></li><li className={"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"}><i className={"ph ph-clock"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i>{"6 min read"}</li></ul></div><p className={"mt-9 font-heading text-[clamp(1.3125rem,1.15rem_+_0.6vw,1.625rem)] font-medium leading-[1.45] tracking-[-0.015em] text-text"}>{"A digital twin is a live model of a structure, fed by the site as it is built. On Kestrel Crossing we ran design, construction and inspection from one for 38 months. This is what changed, and what did not."}</p><h2 className={"text-[clamp(1.625rem,1.3rem_+_1vw,2.125rem)]"}>{"One model instead of three"}</h2><p>{"On most projects the designers keep one model, the contractor another, and the client receives a third at handover. Each is accurate on the day it is issued and drifts from there. On Kestrel Crossing there was one federated model, owned by the project rather than by any one team."}</p><p>{"Every pile, deck segment and stay had a record in it. When the survey crew measured a pylon lift, the reading went into the model the same evening, and the designers checked it against its tolerance the next morning."}</p><figure className={"article-wide"}><div className={"custom-art-figure-frame custom-chamfer relative aspect-video bg-muted max-md:aspect-[3/2]"}><img className={"absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover"} src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/1600x1067.svg"} alt={"An engineer checking the stay forces in the pylon model on two screens"} width={"1600"} height={"1067"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /><span className={"custom-cross"} aria-hidden={"true"}></span></div><figcaption className={"custom-art-caption grid gap-3.5 text-[1rem] leading-[1.55] text-start text-soft"}><span className={"custom-dim"} style={{"--dim-delay": "0.3s"}} data-anim={""}><span className={"custom-dim-run"}></span><span className={"custom-dim-label"}>{"520 m main span"}</span><span className={"custom-dim-run"}></span></span><span className={"max-w-184"}>{"The main span in the model: each of the 96 stays carries its design force, its measured force and the date it was last checked."}</span></figcaption></figure><h2 className={"text-[clamp(1.625rem,1.3rem_+_1vw,2.125rem)]"}>{"What changed on site"}</h2><p>{"The first change was speed. A site query used to travel by email to the design office and back in about a week. With the twin it took a day, because the engineer on the deck and the engineer at the desk were looking at the same object."}</p><ul className={"custom-art-figures grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-10 pl-0 list-none"} role={"list"}><li className={"grid gap-2 [align-content:start] pt-5 border-t border-t-(--custom-draw)"}><p className={"custom-figure"}>{"1"}<span className={"custom-figure-unit"}>{"day"}</span></p><p className={"text-[1rem] leading-[1.5]"}>{"for a site change to reach the drawings, down from seven"}</p></li><li className={"grid gap-2 [align-content:start] mt-0 pt-5 border-t border-t-(--custom-draw)"}><p className={"custom-figure"}>{"38"}<span className={"custom-figure-unit"}>{"%"}</span></p><p className={"text-[1rem] leading-[1.5]"}>{"fewer late design changes than on our previous cable-stayed bridge"}</p></li></ul><p>{"The second change was trust. Supervisors began to open the model on tablets at the workface, not because they were asked to, but because it was the quickest way to see what the next lift involved."}</p><figure className={"custom-art-quote grid gap-5 my-13 py-9"}><blockquote><p className={"font-heading text-[clamp(1.625rem,1.25rem_+_1.4vw,2.375rem)] font-medium leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.025em] text-text text-balance"}>{"The model only earns its place when the person pouring concrete trusts it more than the drawing in their pocket."}</p></blockquote><figcaption className={"grid mt-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-start text-soft"}><strong className={"font-heading text-[1.0625rem]"}>{"Isla Morrison"}</strong>{"Chief Engineer, Framo Engineering"}</figcaption></figure><h2 className={"text-[clamp(1.625rem,1.3rem_+_1vw,2.125rem)]"}>{"What did not change"}</h2><p>{"A twin does not replace judgement. Every lift was still rehearsed at the planning wall, every stay still signed off by a chartered engineer, and every shift still started with ten minutes at the workface."}</p><p>{"Three lessons we now apply to every project:"}</p><ul><li><strong>{"Give the model one owner,"}</strong>{" and make that owner the project, not a team."}</li><li><strong>{"Feed it the same day:"}</strong>{" a measurement that waits a week is already history."}</li><li><strong>{"Train the supervisors first;"}</strong>{" the engineers will follow them."}</li></ul><p>{"Kestrel Crossing opened in 2026, and its twin did not stop at handover. The Clyde Connect Partnership now uses it to plan inspections, and the strain gauges on the stays report to it every ten minutes."}</p><div className={"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 mt-14 pt-8 border-t border-t-(--custom-line)"}><ul className={"custom-chips gap-2 mt-0 mb-0"} role={"list"} aria-label={"Topics"}><li className={"custom-chip"}>{"Digital"}</li><li className={"custom-chip mt-0"}>{"Bridges"}</li><li className={"custom-chip mt-0"}>{"Kestrel Crossing"}</li></ul><ul className={"social-list gap-2"} role={"list"} aria-label={"Share this article"}><li><a href={"#"} className={"social-link social-link--circle social-link--outline social-link--sm"} data-social={"linkedin"} aria-label={"Share on LinkedIn"}><i className={"ph ph-linkedin-logo"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></li><li className={"mt-0